# With no loss the ring is a pure phase filter: flat amplitude, all the structure is in the delay.

title All-pass ring without loss
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.54 1.56 4001

comp c coupler kappa=0.1
comp w waveguide length=62.8318530718
link c.4 w.1
link w.2 c.2
port in c.1
port through c.3

expect lossless 1e-8
expect extinction through 0 1e-7
